# Normalise line endings in the repository, while each machine keeps its own.
#
# The monorepo this folder came out of carries a file like this one, and it does not reach
# here: a repository needs its own copy. The types listed below are the ones actually tracked
# in this mod, counted rather than guessed.

* text=auto

# ---------- Text ----------

*.cs     text diff=csharp
*.xml    text
*.md     text
*.csproj text
*.props  text
LICENSE  text

# ---------- Binaries: neither normalised nor diffed as text ----------

*.png binary
*.dll binary
